 "notes": "Lounge chair is new (design classics moved out of the old armchair list); Wingback and Club chair are new kinds. Armchair trimmed from 35 flat models (16 IKEA) to 10 plus Poäng and Louis Ghost archetypes; old IKEA 'r' range lists dropped as duplicated brand ranges. Dropped models: LILLESATER, OSKARSHAMN (moved to wingback), PERSBOL, HERRAKRA, SOTENAS, ROCKSJON (IKEA SKU noise); blank-maker 'Hanging Egg Chair' (now Ditzel archetype). Left out for lack of a retrievable source this session: Windsor rocker, Queen Anne wingback, Stressless (Ekornes), Ditzel chair's original maker (Wengler), Tongue chair model number (577) and exact year (sources say 1963/1967/1968), Red and Blue Chair's current maker (Cassina), Ball/Bubble chair makers, Pastil chair. Wikidata was rate-limited (HTTP 429); cassina.com, moma.org, brooklynmuseum.org, twentytwentyone.com blocked (403) and not retried. Archetype mk for design classics is the current licensed maker; the designer is named in d. Rocking-chair models from Tutti Bambini are nursing rockers."
